${\bf u}^0$, ${\bf u}^1$ satisfies $$\|{\bf u}(t^0)-{\bf u}^0\|_X+\|{\bf u}(t^1)-{\bf u}^1\|_X \leq C_1h$$
for a generic constant $C_1$ independent of $\Delta t$ and $h$. Then, the error satisfies,
\begin{gather}
\|{\bf u}(t^{{M}+1})-{\bf u}^{{M}+1}\|^2  +{ \frac{3}{4}(\nu_1+\nu_T)\Delta t\sum_{n=1}^{M}\|\nabla  (u_1(t^{n+1})-u_{h,1}^{n+1})\|^2}\nonumber
